# Two defs: card, a rounded rect named body with ink outline, a paper dot named dot centered horizontally in the upper half, a small gold dot named tag at the top-left, and an empty slot named mark below the center;
# pair, two small cards named left and right side by side. 256x128 artboard, two rows of four, each centered in its 64x64 cell.
# Top row, left to right: card 40 as declared (blue square, paper dot in the upper half, small gold dot at top-left, nothing below the center);
# card 40 with its mark slot filled by the caller with a red circle of radius 6 (the red circle sits below the center, inside the blue square); card 40 patched with `.body fill:p.green` (the same square, now green, dots unchanged);
# card 40 patched with `.dot off` (blue square with only the gold dot at top-left, the paper dot is gone).
# Bottom row, left to right: pair as declared (two small blue squares side by side, each with a paper dot and a gold dot); pair patched with `.left.dot off` (the left square has no paper dot, the right one still has it, a nested patch);
# pair patched with `.right off` (only the left card remains, the right half of the cell is empty paper); pair patched with `.left.body fill:p.red` and `.right.body fill:p.green` (left card red, right card green, each with a gold tag at its top-left and a paper dot).
@artboard 256x128
@target components/slots_patches.png

def card size:40 tone:p.blue
  rect 100%,100% r:4 fill:tone stroke:p.ink,2 name:body
  circle 20% at:0,-size*.15 fill:p.paper name:dot
  circle 12% at:-size*.3,-size*.3 fill:p.gold name:tag
  slot mark at:0,size*.25

def pair size:60
  card 26 at:-15,0 name:left
  card 26 at:15,0 name:right

card 40 at:32,32 name:c1
card 40 at:96,32 name:c2
  mark:
    circle 6 fill:p.red
card 40 at:160,32 name:c3
  .body fill:p.green
card 40 at:224,32 name:c4
  .dot off
pair at:32,96 name:p1
pair at:96,96 name:p2
  .left.dot off
pair at:160,96 name:p3
  .right off
pair at:224,96 name:p4
  .left.body fill:p.red
  .right.body fill:p.green
